  "claim_class": "simulated_activity_plus_dramsim3_and_cacti_selected_arrays",
  "limitations": [
    "The two archived workloads are vertical energy-accounting evidence, not a matched graph/workload performance or energy comparison.",
    "The Spine run uses the accepted older 9c08763 hardware profile at its achieved 141 MHz clock; it is not an afb8199 latest-source energy result.",
    "CACTI-P models projected 32 nm ASIC SRAM arrays; it does not model U55C BRAM/URAM or FPGA board power.",
    "Selected-array plus DRAM energy is intentionally labeled partial and must not be reported as total accelerator energy.",
    "Logic, interconnect, clock-tree, host, shell, and unlisted small-memory energy require synthesis activity or board measurements.",
    "The GraSU/ReGraph result is normalized and conversion-free; no matching weighted PMA-native HLS has been synthesized yet."
  ],
